     "body": "<p>Was this desired all along? According to the R<a href=\"http://README.md\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">EADME.md:</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo-exts/migration-utils/blob/main/README.md?plain=1#L200\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo-exts/migration-utils/blob/main/README.md?plain=1#L200</a> </p>\n\n<p>Marked as Not Yet Implemented</p>\n\n<p><em>All fcrepo 3 DC (Dublin Core) datastream values are mapped as dcterms properties on the Object in fcrepo 6+. The same goes for any properties in the RELS-EXT and RELS-INT datastreams.</em></p>",
