     "body": "<p>Thanks <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=60ddbb488a72bd006c7fec8a\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"60ddbb488a72bd006c7fec8a\" data-account-id=\"60ddbb488a72bd006c7fec8a\" accountid=\"60ddbb488a72bd006c7fec8a\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Paul Trilsbeek</a> I will wrap the feature in a commandline option so that people can chose whether they wan to bring their DC into Fedora 6 or not. If they don’t have any, it will just bypass that feature anyway.</p>\n\n",
